        <paragraph>For functions $$f(x) = 7x - 8$$ and $$g(x) = 7x + 8,$$ find ⓐ $$\left( {f \cdot g} \right)(x)$$ ⓑ $$\left( {f \cdot g} \right)(-2)$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$(f\cdot g)(x)=49x2-64(f\cdot g)(x)=49x2-64$$ ⓑ $$(f\cdot g)(-2)=132(f\cdot g)(-2)=132$$</paragraph>
